{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0198teZizqVb2uJC1UdLLRux","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found it. Here's the complete information:\n\n**File Location:** `/home/ubuntu/agent-ml-research/skills/global/dream-review-full.skill.md`\n\n**Key Details:**\n- **Name:** dream-review-full\n- **Scope:** global\n- **Version:** 1\n- **Roles:** dream_review_director\n\n**Summary:**\nThis is the complete Dream Review template for full review mode (2 Reviewers + roundtable). It defines the workflow for simulated paper reviews with the following structure:\n\n1. **Step 1 — Distribution:** Reviewer 1 handles methods + experiments; Reviewer 2 handles novelty + related work\n2. **Step 2 — Cross-Share:** Reviewers exchange and comment on each other's reports\n3. **Step 3 — Convergence:** Judge if reviewers have reached consensus (max 3 rounds)\n4. **Step 4 — Synthesis:** Combine both reviewers' final opinions and submit via `submit_dream_review_report()`\n\nKey differences from simple mode:\n- 2 Reviewers instead of 1\n- Mandatory cross-sharing and convergence steps\n- No formatting reviewer (format is meaningless for simulated papers)\n- No issue tracker or external review\n- Output to `artifacts/dream_reports/{dream_id}/{tier}/review_report.md`"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bdddd11e-d286-40ab-b887-efee4a12ef04","uuid":"3bcd8a1d-a4e9-4934-97a2-575aac5f3717","timestamp":"2026-05-13T02:21:02.603Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the dream-review-full skill file. Search for files matching patterns like \"dream-review-full*\", \"dream_review_full*\", or any skill file containing \"dream-review\" in its name or content, under /home/ubuntu/agent-ml-research/ and /home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_8/. Search breadth: very thorough.","agentId":"aeeb97e16a795a854","agentType":"Explore","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found it. Here's the complete information:\n\n**File Location:**